      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Three railroads—Oklahoma City, Ada and Atoka; the Rock Island; and the Missouri, Kansas and Texas—began operating there in 1885, spurring rapid growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
