      ],
      "source": "https://okgenweb.net/~okcoal/place/coalgate.htm",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The WPA built the Coalgate High School gymnasium in 1939, which later earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
